% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% backend: none
% expect-output: the quick brown fox
% expect-output: still open
% Scenario: NullEncode passes what is written through to its target
% unchanged and adds no marker; closefile without CloseTarget leaves
% the target open.
% Expect: the bytes, then a line written to the target afterwards.
(%stdout) (w) file /NullEncode filter
dup (the quick brown fox\n) writestring closefile
(still open) =
